   242	### 3.4 `release-relay.yml` — relay staging
   243	
   244	Trigger: reusable workflow call only from the exact full-SHA-pinned trusted
   245	release workflow recorded by an accepted `release-prepare.yml` candidate.
   246	Direct PR, branch, tag, relative local, mutable-ref, or arbitrary workflow calls
