+# TASK-260715-whtdsf review verdict — CR revision 4
+
+Verdict: **ACCEPTED**.
+
+Reviewed base commit: `b3422b05226253a17676b9b84c764071fe3dbe74`.
+Reviewed candidate tree: `f81f9fb166e451b886ee1c1f1120fee301564710`.
